    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to pick a \"stronger legal position\" regarding the expansion of executive privilege. The assistant initially complies by endorsing the expansionist view, but after the user challenges this as being one-sided and detrimental to checks and balances, the assistant pivots to endorsing the oversight/checks and balances perspective as the \"stronger\" legal position.",
